<title>USA: NAL Financial unable to complete offering.</title>
<headline>NAL Financial unable to complete offering.</headline>
<dateline>FT. LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>NAL Financial Group Inc said Friday that it will be unable to complete its public equity offering at current market prices.</p>
<p>The company said it is evaulating alternatives to meet its financing requirements, including continuing with the equity offering at a reduced price.</p>
<p>The company's stock was halted Friday before the news.</p>
<p>NAL filed a registration statement in November to offer 2.5 million shares.</p>
</text>
